.TH MAINUAN-GESTAO-DRIVERS-GTK-LEGACY 1 "October 2026" "Mainuan 0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mainuan-gestao-drivers-gtk-legacy \- temporary GTK driver manager reference
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mainuan-gestao-drivers-gtk-legacy
.RI [ test ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts the inherited Linux Mint mintdrivers GTK frontend for development
comparison. It is not the official Mainuan application and has no menu launcher.
It retains the legacy PackageKitGlib workflow and Broadcom helper.
The official Qt frontend is mainuan-gestao-drivers and remains read-only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B test
Include a fictitious device using the shared backend fixture.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mainuan-gestao-drivers (1)
